# Developer Specification & Prompt: Admin Panel Directory Integration

## Task Objective
Implement a fully functional **Directory** feature in the ProjectVerse Admin Portal. The directory must present two tabs: **Teams** and **Students**. Clicking any item from these directories must open a sleek slide-over side drawer containing detailed metrics, progress, associations, and skill logs. The system must utilize the existing backend service endpoints by defining clean API routes.

