## 🎨 UI/UX Design Guidelines
- **Color Palettes**: Avoid generic colors. Use HSL/Hex variables from standard CSS system.
- **Animations**: Include micro-animations for card hovers (slight elevation and scale transitions) and slide-over entries (slide from right, blur overlay animation).
- **Responsive**: Grids must shift from 1 column on mobile to 2 columns on tablets, and 3 columns on desktop.

