## 🧪 Verification & Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Directory renders and loads teams by default.
- [ ] Switching tabs pulls the correct corresponding data from the API.
- [ ] Real-time search filters cards instantaneously based on user input.
- [ ] Slide-overs render the exact detailed records cleanly without overlay conflicts.
- [ ] Escape key closes any active drawer immediately.
- [ ] Build compiles successfully via `npm run build` with zero TypeScript compiler errors.
